          "source_count": 1,
          "verification": "single_source",
          "explainable": false,
          "importance": 6.0,
          "body": "Dell Technologies said on Monday it has strengthened the portfolio and capabilities of its “Dell AI Factory with NVIDIA” to support large-scale data preparation, infrastructure management and adoption of validated solutions so companies can run AI stably from the outset.\n\n The company said new data orchestration and storage engine functions have been added to the Dell AI Data Platform, allowing customers to prepare data regardless of where it is stored and convert it into reliable context that AI agents can use.\n\n Dell also enhanced data orchestration so AI agents can use distributed enterprise data on customers’ own infrastructure.\n\n The Agentic Data Gateway provides a single governance path so all AI agents can access enterprise data and context.\n\n Hybrid data pipeline orchestration runs pipelines directly across environments where data is stored, including on-premises private clouds, ",
